error[type]: type mismatch: expected Int, got Option(Int)
 --> main.silt:27:16
    |
 27 |   let a: Int = half(4)
    |                ^^^^^^^ type mismatch: expected Int, got Option(Int)
  = help: to chain through an `Option`, use `?` to propagate `None`, or `|> o.flat_map { x -> ... }` to continue the pipeline on the Some value

error[type]: type mismatch: expected Int, got Result(Int, String)
 --> main.silt:28:16
